{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEEING RED</strong>\u00a0<strong>Demo</strong>, first-person survival horror game that offers an intense and immersive experience. This product includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Level Story\u00a0</strong>\u2013 A gripping, atmospheric narrative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Combat</strong> \u2013 Use firearms and melee weapons to fight off relentless monsters, but beware\u2014ammo and stamina are limited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; Evasion</strong> \u2013 Hide, run, or find alternative ways to survive against creatures hunting you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles &amp; Lore Discovery</strong> \u2013 Solve cryptic puzzles, piece together hidden lore, and unveil the truth behind the horrors that surround you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Horror Experience</strong> \u2013 Photorealistic visuals, dynamic sound design, and psychological horror elements that heighten tension and fear.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482050?t=1754597453","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482050/70a60dcd7706fdb8988575fb2c57782791426ae6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754597453","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482050/1115c6514f8124f2363ae12aad925ad692cf4cde/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754597453","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482050/1115c6514f8124f2363ae12aad925ad692cf4cde/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754597453","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is blood, on the gr